<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-THURSDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-THURSDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches on Centre Court</p>
<p>at the French Open tennis championships on Thursday (all matches</p>
<p>semifinals; play starts 1200 GMT; prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles:</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v 3-Monica Seles (U.S.)</p>
<p>9-Iva Majoli (Croatia) v 11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>Men's doubles:</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)/Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>v 2-Jacco Eltingh/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
</text>
